  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.105 - AM031 respects mutually exclusive conditional branches\n- Opposite ternary branches no longer count as repeated enumeration\n- Same-branch and unconditional-plus-conditional terminal pairs still report\n- Nested conditional leaves are compared by co-executable paths\n- Existing collection-key and code-fix behavior remains unchanged\n- No rule ID or severity changes",
